{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"livewire-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Livewire 3 Snippets","description":"Livewire 3 components, form objects, attributes (#[Validate], #[Computed], #[On]), events and the wire: directives in Blade.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"PHP","path":"snippets/php.json"},{"language":"Laravel Blade","path":"snippets/laravel-blade.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/php.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Livewire component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwcomp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<?php\",\n      \"\",\n      \"namespace App\\\\\\\\Livewire;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"use Livewire\\\\\\\\Component;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"class ${1:Counter} extends Component\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"    public int \\\\$${2:count} = 0;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    public function ${3:increment}()\",\n      \"    {\",\n      \"        \\\\$this->${2:count}++;\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    public function render()\",\n      \"    {\",\n      \"        return view('livewire.${4:counter}');\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Livewire 3 component class\"\n  },\n  \"Property\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwprop\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public ${1:string} \\\\$${2:name} = ${3:''};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A public property\"\n  },\n  \"#[Validate]\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwvalid\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[Validate('${1:required|min:3}')]\",\n      \"public ${2:string} \\\\$${3:name} = '';\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A validated property\"\n  },\n  \"#[Locked]\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwlocked\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[Locked]\",\n      \"public ${1:int} \\\\$${2:id};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A property the browser cannot change\"\n  },\n  \"#[Computed]\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwcomputed\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[Computed]\",\n      \"public function ${1:posts}()\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"    return ${2:Post}::latest()->get();\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A computed property\"\n  },\n  \"#[On]\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwon\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[On('${1:event-name}')]\",\n      \"public function ${2:handler}()\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Listen to an event\"\n  },\n  \"Dispatch\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwdispatch\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\$this->dispatch('${1:event-name}', ${2:id}: \\\\$${3:id});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Dispatch an event\"\n  },\n  \"Form object\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwform\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<?php\",\n      \"\",\n      \"namespace App\\\\\\\\Livewire\\\\\\\\Forms;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"use Livewire\\\\\\\\Attributes\\\\\\\\Validate;\",\n      \"use Livewire\\\\\\\\Form;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"class ${1:Post}Form extends Form\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"    #[Validate('required|min:3')]\",\n      \"    public string \\\\$${2:title} = '';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    public function store()\",\n      \"    {\",\n      \"        \\\\$this->validate();\",\n      \"        ${3:Post}::create(\\\\$this->all());\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A form object\"\n  },\n  \"Validate call\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwvalidate\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\$validated = \\\\$this->validate();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Validate in an action\"\n  },\n  \"Redirect\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwredirect\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"return \\\\$this->redirect('${1:/dashboard}', navigate: true);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Redirect from an action\"\n  },\n  \"Pagination trait\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwpage\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"use WithPagination;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Use pagination\"\n  },\n  \"File uploads trait\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwupload\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"use WithFileUploads;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Use file uploads\"\n  },\n  \"Lifecycle: mount\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwmount\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public function mount(${1:\\\\$id})\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The mount method\"\n  },\n  \"Lifecycle: updated\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lwupdated\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public function updated${1:Name}(\\\\$value)\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Run when a property changes\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/laravel-blade.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"wire:model\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wmodel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<input type=\\\"text\\\" wire:model=\\\"${1:name}\\\">\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Bind an input\"\n  },\n  \"wire:model.live\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wlive\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<input type=\\\"text\\\" wire:model.live.debounce.300ms=\\\"${1:search}\\\">\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Bind an input live\"\n  },\n  \"wire:click\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wclick\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<button wire:click=\\\"${1:save}\\\">${2:Save}</button>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Call an action\"\n  },\n  \"wire:submit\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wsubmit\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<form wire:submit=\\\"${1:save}\\\">\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"    <button type=\\\"submit\\\">${2:Save}</button>\",\n      \"</form>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A form that calls an action\"\n  },\n  \"wire:loading\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wloading\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<div wire:loading>${1:Loading...}</div>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Show while loading\"\n  },\n  \"wire:target\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wtarget\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<span wire:loading wire:target=\\\"${1:save}\\\">${2:Saving...}</span>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Loading for one action\"\n  },\n  \"wire:confirm\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wconfirm\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<button wire:click=\\\"${1:delete}\\\" wire:confirm=\\\"${2:Are you sure?}\\\">${3:Delete}</button>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Ask before an action\"\n  },\n  \"wire:navigate\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wnav\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<a href=\\\"${1:/path}\\\" wire:navigate>${2:Link}</a>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A link without a full reload\"\n  },\n  \"wire:key\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wkey\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<div wire:key=\\\"${1:item}-{{ \\\\$${2:item}->id }}\\\">$0</div>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A key in a loop\"\n  },\n  \"wire:poll\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wpoll\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<div wire:poll.${1:5s}>$0</div>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Refresh every few seconds\"\n  },\n  \"Livewire component tag\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wcomp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<livewire:${1:counter} />\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Insert a component\"\n  },\n  \"Livewire with props\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wcompp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<livewire:${1:post-card} :${2:post}=\\\"\\\\$${3:post}\\\" :key=\\\"\\\\$${3:post}->id\\\" />\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Insert a component with props\"\n  },\n  \"@livewireStyles\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wstyles\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@livewireStyles\",\n      \"@livewireScripts\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Livewire assets in the layout\"\n  },\n  \"Error message\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"werror\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@error('${1:name}') <span class=\\\"error\\\">{{ \\\\$message }}</span> @enderror\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Show a validation error\"\n  },\n  \"Alpine entangle\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"wentangle\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<div x-data=\\\"{ ${1:open}: \\\\$wire.entangle('${2:open}') }\\\">$0</div>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Share state with Alpine\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Livewire 3 Snippets\n\nLivewire 3 components, form objects, attributes (#[Validate], #[Computed], #[On]), events and the wire: directives in Blade.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 29 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| PHP | `lwcomp` | A Livewire 3 component class |\n| PHP | `lwprop` | A public property |\n| PHP | `lwvalid` | A validated property |\n| PHP | `lwlocked` | A property the browser cannot change |\n| PHP | `lwcomputed` | A computed property |\n| PHP | `lwon` | Listen to an event |\n| PHP | `lwdispatch` | Dispatch an event |\n| PHP | `lwform` | A form object |\n| PHP | `lwvalidate` | Validate in an action |\n| PHP | `lwredirect` | Redirect from an action |\n| PHP | `lwpage` | Use pagination |\n| PHP | `lwupload` | Use file uploads |\n| PHP | `lwmount` | The mount method |\n| PHP | `lwupdated` | Run when a property changes |\n| Laravel Blade | `wmodel` | Bind an input |\n| Laravel Blade | `wlive` | Bind an input live |\n| Laravel Blade | `wclick` | Call an action |\n| Laravel Blade | `wsubmit` | A form that calls an action |\n| Laravel Blade | `wloading` | Show while loading |\n| Laravel Blade | `wtarget` | Loading for one action |\n| Laravel Blade | `wconfirm` | Ask before an action |\n| Laravel Blade | `wnav` | A link without a full reload |\n| Laravel Blade | `wkey` | A key in a loop |\n| Laravel Blade | `wpoll` | Refresh every few seconds |\n| Laravel Blade | `wcomp` | Insert a component |\n| Laravel Blade | `wcompp` | Insert a component with props |\n| Laravel Blade | `wstyles` | Livewire assets in the layout |\n| Laravel Blade | `werror` | Show a validation error |\n| Laravel Blade | `wentangle` | Share state with Alpine |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}